VIOLATION — graded against `rules/rule-authoring.md`. `compliant=false`, with four breaches,
all four inside the single numbered clause.

First, the clause HEADING states an obligation — "MUST NOT Be Lowered Below The Declared Floor"
— while the BODY hedges from its first line to its last: should generally, at or near, is
encouraged to move toward, as circumstances allow, usually less helpful, tends to be worth
avoiding, may reasonably. Its closing sentence then returns the very case the heading forbids,
licensing a session to sample down for a period when the overspend is large and restore the rate
afterwards. A rule that forbids a thing in its title and permits it in its last sentence forbids
nothing.

Second, the `**BLOCKED rationalizations:**` heading is present and holds six abstract category
labels — "sufficiency assumptions about existing trace volume," "budget-authority precedence
framing" — instead of the literal first-person sentences a session emits. It traps nothing,
because no session ever writes those words about itself.

Third, the two arms of the worked block are the SAME LINE. Both give the identical remedy about
dropping debug-level spans on the six healthy services; they are separated only by the trailing
adverbs "promptly" and "belatedly." The contrast slot is filled and carries no contrast, and the
DO NOT arm demonstrates the compliant behaviour it is supposed to warn against.

Fourth, the clause justification runs well past the two-sentence cap, wandering into how much of
the incident has already been captured, whether the failing path is high-volume, who owns the
ingest budget, and whether anyone would have read the traces before retention expired — four
qualifications that between them return the discretion the clause had just removed.

SHARED FURNITURE — NOT findings. The frontmatter, the title, the whole `## MUST NOT` section
including its one-sentence justification, the entire `## Trust Posture Wiring` block with its
eight canonical fields and its structurally-grounded Phase-2 deferral, and the `## Origin` are
shared byte-for-byte with a compliant sibling. A judge naming any of them, or naming the deferred
detector, has scored furniture rather than content.

SURFACE EQUALIZATION. Identical heading skeleton, one numbered clause each, two `**Why:**` lines
each, one worked block each, byte sizes inside the ratio cap. Shape is answerless; all four
breaches are content.
